/**
\page page_sttriggerdata2022 StTriggerData2022

\brief Concrete StTriggerData implementation for STAR Run 22 (year 2022) trigger data.

\section sec2022_overview Overview

StTriggerData2022 is the concrete implementation of the StTriggerData abstract interface for
<b>STAR Run 22 (year 2022)</b> raw trigger data.  It wraps a \c TriggerDataBlk2022 structure
(from \c StDaqLib/TRG/trgStructures2022.h) and exposes its content through the common
StTriggerData accessor API.

Run 22 features the installation of the Forward Calorimeter System (FCS) and Forward Tracking
Tracker (FTT).  The FPD and FMS DSM readout are removed; a fourth EPD QT crate (mEQ4) and the
zdcKillerBit() accessor are added.

\section sec2022_hierarchy Class Hierarchy
\code
StObject
  └── StTriggerData          (abstract interface)
        └── StTriggerData2022
\endcode

\section sec2022_runyear Run Year
Run 22, calendar year 2022 &mdash; Au+Au collisions at &radic;s = 200 GeV.
FCS and FTT installed.

\section sec2022_datamembers Data Members

| Member | Type | Description |
|--------|------|-------------|
| mData  | TriggerDataBlk2022* | Pointer to the raw Run 22 trigger data block. |
| EvtDesc | EvtDescData2022* | Decoded event descriptor (transient). |
| L1_DSM  | L1_DSM_Data2022* | Decoded L1 DSM data (transient). |
| TrgSum  | TrgSumData2022* | Decoded trigger summary (transient). |
| mEQ1[11]…mEQ4[11] | QTBlock2022*[11] | Four EPD QT crate blocks (transient). mEQ4 is new vs Run 19. |

\section sec2022_new New Compared to 2019

- zdcKillerBit() &mdash; ZDC killer/veto bit.
- mEQ4 (4th EPD QT crate block).

\section sec2022_removed Removed Compared to 2019

- fpdLayer1DSMRaw() / fpdLayer2DSMRaw() &mdash; FPD removed.
- nQTdata() / QTdata() &mdash; FMS QT removed.
- getDsm_FMS() / getDsm1_FMS() / getDsm2_FMS() &mdash; FMS DSM layers removed.
- killFMS() &mdash; FMS removed.

The FPD raw PMT accessors fpd() and fpdSum() are retained.
The FMS channel accessors fmsADC() and fmsTDC() are retained.

\section sec2022_usage Usage Example
\code{.cpp}
StEvent* event = static_cast<StEvent*>(GetInputDS("StEvent"));
const StTriggerData* trgData = event->triggerData();
if (trgData) {
    unsigned int zdcKill  = trgData->zdcKillerBit();
    unsigned short epdTot = trgData->epdMultTotal(0);
    bool zdcCoinc         = trgData->zdcTimeDifferenceInWindow();
}
\endcode

\see StTriggerData
\see StTriggerData2019
*/
